{
 "_about": "Offline cases for the advisor's script-first layer (app/advisor-scripts.js), run by `npm run eval:advisor -- --scripted` with no model and no network. Each case names a page snapshot built by scripts/lib/advisor_snapshot.mjs from the repository's own data files (county bundles, app/data tables) plus, for lots, fixture parcel facts that are test inputs only. expect is the intent the layer must answer with, or handoff (it must send the question to the Worker). must_include entries in braces are resolved from the raw data files at run time: {bg:FIPS:FIELD} the bundle's default block group (money), {bgraw:FIPS:FIELD} the same as a plain number, {hud:FIPS:BEDROOMS} HUD FMR (money), a *12 suffix multiplies, {sites:FIPS:count} measured sites, {top1:FIPS} the engine's first ranked area.",
 "created": "2026-11-19",
